# The board in API mode: every read and write goes over HTTP to the API's routes.
# The status line names the API's host, whose port changes between runs.
mask /127\.0\.0\.1:\d+/ "127.0.0.1:<port>"
wait Export posts from the old CMS
wait /API 127\.0\.0\.1/
frame opened

press tab
wait /(?m)^╭.*┏/
press a
wait Enter item title
type Rotate the API keys
press enter
wait ○ Rotate the API keys
frame item-added

press q
exits
